<title>USA: DST Systems Inc Q4 net up.</title>
<headline>DST Systems Inc Q4 net up.</headline>
<dateline>KANSAS CITY, Mo. 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			 $ 0.24			n/a</p>
<p> Net			 11,828			 90</p>
<p> Revs		     153,761		  132,452</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  49,679			n/a</p>
<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1995 Q4 results included equity accounting for a non-recurring charge of $8.4 million to acquire Continuum Co. Excluding the $7.7 million after-tax charge, 1995 Q4 net would have been $7.8 million.  </p>
<p>			    YEAR</p>
<p> Shr			  $3.35			n/a</p>
<p> Net			167,202		   27,040</p>
<p> Revs		     580,808		  484,131</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  49,871			n/a</p>
<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: DST's net income for the 1996 year would have been $44.0 million, or $0.88/shr, if all Continuum-related equity in earnings, gains and charges were eliminated.</p>
<p>	     ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
